# starlette (transitive, via fastapi) used to be pinned by fastapi==0.115.0's
# own constraint (starlette>=0.37.2,<0.39.0) to 0.38.6, which carried known
# CVEs with no fix release inside that range. fastapi>=0.135.0 lifts that
# ceiling (starlette>=0.46.0, no upper bound), which resolves to a starlette
# release with every one of those CVEs fixed. Previously documented as an
# accepted risk in docs/adr/0018 pending this upgrade — full backend test
# suite (including tests/security/) passes unchanged against the new pins.
